      "source": "Returns whether supplying values for the properties returned via <a href=\"ProjectionInformation.html#getInputProperties()\"><code>ProjectionInformation.getInputProperties()</code></a> is sufficient to\ncreate a working proxy instance.",
      "translation": "返回是否提供通过<a href=\"ProjectionInformation.html#getInputProperties()\"><code>ProjectionInformation.getInputProperties()</code></a> 返回的属性值足以创建可工作的代理实例。",
      "count": 1
