    {
      "source": "Returns whether supplying values for the properties returned via <a href=\"ProjectionInformation.html#getInputProperties()\"><code>ProjectionInformation.getInputProperties()</code></a> is sufficient to\ncreate a working proxy instance. This will usually be used to determine whether the projection uses any dynamically\nresolved properties.",
      "translation": "返回通过<a href=\"ProjectionInformation.html#getInputProperties()\"><code>ProjectionInformation.getInputProperties()</code></a>返回的属性提供值是否足以创建可工作的代理实例。这通常用于确定投影是否使用任何动态解析的属性。",
      "count": 1
    },
